      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Fragment smoke test\n\nThis graph holds **one stand-in**, the node on the right. The rest of it is a piece in another file.\n\n1. Select the stand-in and expand it.\n2. Two nodes appear that are not in this file, under ids of this graph.\n3. Save: the file does not gain them. Collapse: they go, and the stand-in is back."
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "fragment-smoke-host"
        }
      }
